.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-008\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Its central beliefs are monotheism\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text lists monotheism among central beliefs.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-009\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the Trinity (God as Father, Son, and Holy Spirit)\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text defines the Trinity without specifying Jesus after Son.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-010\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the incarnation and divinity of Jesus\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text lists both incarnation and divinity as central beliefs.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-011\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"salvation by God's grace through faith in Christ's death and resurrection\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this as a central belief.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-012\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Its sacred text is the Bible\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text identifies the Bible as Christianity's sacred text.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-013\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"made up of the Old and New Testaments\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states the Bible's composition without language labels.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-014\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"which Christians regard as the inspired and authoritative Word of God\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text